Draft a billing dispute resolution email for the following:
- Customer Name: {{input.start__output__customerName}}
- Invoice Number: {{input.start__output__invoiceNumber}}
- Approved Credit Amount: ${{input.start__output__creditAmount}}

The email body must explicitly mention invoice number {{input.start__output__invoiceNumber}} and the approved credit of ${{input.start__output__creditAmount}}. Return a JSON object with "subject" and "body" fields only.
